\title{M2 · Package the needed homotopy machinery}
\taxon{Milestone}
\meta{id}{M2}
\meta{origin}{design/08-roadmap.md}
\meta{status}{planned}
\tag{milestone}

\p{Generalize \ref{ms-foundation}'s Kan, diagram, reduced replacement, and relative-mapping lemmas into the exportable Space/diagram API (\ref{at-kr-0010}/11). Complete categorical \code{MapCat}/\code{Fun} bootstrap bridges needed by \ref{ms-0003}/\ref{ms-0004}. Do not assume the category of all VDCs has an already-proved localization model merely because Segal categories do.}
\p{\strong{Exit:} all hypotheses of the \ref{ms-0003} constructions are supplied by checked lemmas. \strong{Freeze:} the proved Space and diagram primitives, not future construction promises.}
